{
  "@context": "context.jsonld",
  "@id": "sheets",
  "@type": "App",
  "position": 1,
  "id": "sheets",
  "family": "office",
  "icon": "📊",
  "name": "Data",
  "surface": "window",
  "url": "../../magpie/edot/data/data.html",
  "desc": "Spreadsheet, SQL, RDF",
  "capabilities": [
    "storage"
  ],
  "silent": true,
  "notes": [
    "MIGRATED (July 2026). Data keeps one SQLite blob, and kept it in IndexedDB — which an opaque origin refuses to open. Its engine now picks a backend by trying, and falls back to the same blob base64'd through the store broker. It reports which one is live, and a refused write is announced rather than swallowed: this is the app where a silent autosave failure costs the most."
  ]
}
